    "name":  "PACK - Aluminum Profile 2 meters 90º Angular - L - for LED Strips",
    "reference":  "92037-100",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDiscover exceptional angular lighting with our \u003cstrong\u003ePACK - L-Angular aluminum profile\u003c/strong\u003e 2m. With its versatile and durable design, this profile is the perfect choice to enhance your LED strips with elegance and precision. Its angular structure offers easy and secure installation, ensuring impeccable results in any environment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e(End caps and mounting clips included)\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eAluminum Profile 2 meters 90º Angular - L - for LED Strips\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover a new dimension of lighting with our revolutionary Angular Aluminum Profile for LED strips. 2 meters length for impeccable installation.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMade of PURE ALUMINUM by extrusion. Advantages:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLightweight\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCorrosion resistant (natural oxide layer)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDurable\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExcellent thermal conductivity\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSustainable: Highly recyclable\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActs as an efficient heat sink, extending LED strip lifespan.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses: Architectural lighting (cornices, moldings, stairs), indoor, furniture, commercial, outdoor, vehicle.\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED guarantees QUALITY warranty.\u003c/p\u003e",
